<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left">The New Shares will be issued at a price of KRW1,600
per share for a total issue size of KRW 22,400,000,000 (HKD 113,647,894.47). Payment is due on August 10, 2026, with the New Shares expected
to be issued on September 9, 2026, subject to the approval by the Company&rsquo;s shareholders and the progress of Hong Kong registration
and other regulatory filing procedures. The New Shares will be delivered through the Securities Agency Department of the Korea Securities
Depository (KSD) and will be subject to a lock-up period of one (1) year.</P>

